{"name":"Victoria Peak","hex":"#007755","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Victoria Peak","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A mountain in Central and Western district, Hong Kong."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Victoria_Peak"}],"entries":[{"title":"Victoria Peak","blocks":[{"text":"Victoria Peak is a hill on the western half of Hong Kong Island. It is also known as the Mount Austin, and locally as The Peak only generally. With an elevation of 552 metres (1,811 ft), it is the tallest hill on Hong Kong Island, and the 29th tallest in the territory of Hong Kong. It is a major tourist attraction, offering views of Central, Victoria Harbour, Lamma Island and the surrounding islands."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/High_West_and_Victoria_Peak_from_Victoria_Gap_%28crop1%29.jpg/330px-High_West_and_Victoria_Peak_from_Victoria_Gap_%28crop1%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Peak","wikidata":"Q17541"},{"title":"Victoria Peak (Belize)","blocks":[{"text":"Victoria Peak within the Maya Mountains is the second highest mountain in Belize, at a height of 1,120 metres (3,675 ft). The highest peak in the country, Doyle's Delight, at a height of 1,124 metres (3,688 ft), is located 57 kilometres (35 mi) southwest of Victoria Peak. Victoria Peak is situated in the Stann Creek District of Belize, in the Cockscomb Basin Wildlife Sanctuary, and is home to many flora and fauna common to Belize.\nIt was pronounced a natural monument in 1998, comprising about 4,847 acres bordered by the Sittee River Wildlife Reserve, Cockscomb Basin Wildlife Sanctuary, and Chiquibul National Park."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Victoria-peak-2.jpg/330px-Victoria-peak-2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Peak_(Belize)","wikidata":"Q765910"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Peak_Tower_1.jpg/500px-Peak_Tower_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Peak_Tower_1.jpg/1280px-Peak_Tower_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e5/Peak_Tower_1.jpg/500px-Peak_Tower_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APeak_Tower_1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/HK_Peak_Harleck_Road_n_Mt_Austin_Road.JPG/500px-HK_Peak_Harleck_Road_n_Mt_Austin_Road.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/HK_Peak_Harleck_Road_n_Mt_Austin_Road.JPG/500px-HK_Peak_Harleck_Road_n_Mt_Austin_Road.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHK_Peak_Harleck_Road_n_Mt_Austin_Road.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Victoria_Harbour_%28Hong_Kong%29.jpg/500px-Victoria_Harbour_%28Hong_Kong%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Victoria_Harbour_%28Hong_Kong%29.jpg/1280px-Victoria_Harbour_%28Hong_Kong%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Victoria_Harbour_%28Hong_Kong%29.jpg/500px-Victoria_Harbour_%28Hong_Kong%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVictoria_Harbour_(Hong_Kong).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3